  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Egypt Vehicle Scrapping and Recycling Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the Carbon Finance program is to reduce greenhouse gas (GHG) emissions and air pollution associated with the aging fleet of taxi, microbuses, minibuses and buses in Egypt through purchase of Emission Reductions.</narrative>
  </description>
